  "steps": [
    "Marinate the prawns with half the turmeric and salt for 10 minutes.",
    "Heat 1 tbsp of the mustard oil, fry the prawns for 1 minute until just pink and remove.",
    "In the remaining oil add the bay leaves, cardamom, cloves and cinnamon for 20 seconds.",
    "Add the onion and ginger and cook until the raw smell goes without browning, then add the remaining turmeric and the chilli powder.",
    "Pour in the coconut milk with the sugar and green chillies and simmer for 5 minutes.",
    "Return the prawns and cook for 3 minutes, then finish with the garam masala."
  ]
